---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
// TODO(owner): add the privacy contact email and, if needed, the legal name/address of the site owner.
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Elakoo handles personal data from the contact form and embedded YouTube videos.">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>This website (elakoo.com) is run by Elakoo. It is a free catalogue of Greek exam practice videos published on YouTube. There are no user accounts and no payments on this site.</p>

      <h2>Contact form</h2>
      <p>When you send a message, we receive your name, email address, the subject and your message. We use this information only to answer you. The message is delivered to us through Telegram (Telegram Messenger) and/or an email delivery provider, and is not used for marketing. We keep messages only as long as needed to handle your request. You can ask us to delete your message at any time through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
      <p>To protect the form against spam, our hosting provider may process your IP address for a short time (rate limiting).</p>

      <h2>YouTube videos</h2>
      <p>Videos are shown with the official YouTube player in privacy-enhanced mode (youtube-nocookie.com). The player is loaded only after you press Play. Before that, no content is loaded from the YouTube player. Preview images are loaded from YouTube's image servers (i.ytimg.com).</p>
      <p>When you play a video, Google/YouTube may set cookies or similar technologies and process data under the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>. If you block third-party cookies in your browser, you can still open any video directly on YouTube.</p>

      <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
      <p>The site is served over HTTPS. Our hosting provider may keep technical server logs (such as IP address, browser type and time of request) for security and to keep the site running.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask what personal data we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or object to its use. Write to us through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
